{
  "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>kimi-k3 — 언어의 달</title>\n<style>\n:root{\n  --bg:#05070f;\n  --ink:#eef2ff;\n  --muted:#a9b6d8;\n  --accent:#7de3ff;\n  --accent2:#c9a7ff;\n  --panel:rgba(10,15,30,0.86);\n  --line:rgba(125,227,255,0.35);\n  --onAccent:#04121c;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;}\nhtml,body{height:100%;}\nbody{\n  margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Pretendard\",\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,\"Noto Sans KR\",sans-serif;\n  overflow:hidden;line-height:1.5;\n}\nbody.contrast{--bg:#000;--ink:#fff;--muted:#e6e6e6;--accent:#ffd400;--accent2:#8fe8ff;--panel:rgba(0,0,0,0.94);--line:rgba(255,212,0,0.6);--onAccent:#000;}\n\n#scene{position:fixed;inset:0;display:block;touch-action:none;}\n.vignette{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:radial-gradient(120% 120% at 50% 45%, transparent 55%, rgba(0,0,0,0.55) 100%);}\nbody.contrast .vignette{display:none;}\n\n.masthead{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;padding:clamp(0.8rem,2.5vw,1.6rem);pointer-events:none;z-index:3;}\nh1{\n  margin:0;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,7vw,4.2rem);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.02em;line-height:1.1;\n  text-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(125,227,255,0.45),0 0 60px rgba(125,227,255,0.2);\n}\nbody.contrast h1{text-shadow:none;}\n.sub{margin:0.2rem 0 0;color:var(--accent);font-size:clamp(0.78rem,2vw,1rem);letter-spacing:0.08em;}\n.tag{margin:0.15rem 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:clamp(0.78rem,1.8vw,0.95rem);}\n\n.dock{\n  position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:5;\n  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:0.55rem;\n  padding:0.6rem 0.6rem calc(0.6rem + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));\n  pointer-events:none;\n}\n#phrase{\n  margin:0;font-size:clamp(1rem,2.6vw,1.35rem);color:var(--ink);opacity:0.92;\n  text-align:center;letter-spacing:0.04em;padding:0 1rem;\n  text-shadow:0 1px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.75);\n  transition:opacity 0.5s ease;\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){#phrase{transition:none;}}\n\n.controls{pointer-events:auto;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.45rem;justify-content:center;}\nbutton{\n  font:inherit;font-size:0.95rem;min-height:2.75rem;padding:0.4rem 0.95rem;\n  border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);\n  background:var(--panel);color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer;\n}\nbutton:hover{border-color:var(--accent);}\nbutton:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px;}\nbutton[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--onAccent);font-weight:700;}\n\n#help{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:20;display:grid;place-items:center;background:rgba(2,5,12,0.78);padding:1rem;}\n#help[hidden]{display:none;}\n.card{\n  max-width:min(36rem,94vw);max-height:84vh;overflow:auto;\n  background:var(--panel);border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:1rem;\n  padding:1.1rem 1.3rem 1.3rem;\n}\n.cardTop{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:0.4rem;}\n.card h2{margin:0;font-size:1.3rem;}\n.card h3{margin:1rem 0 0.2rem;font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--accent);}\n.card p{margin:0.35rem 0;}\n.card ul{padding-left:1.25rem;margin:0.4rem 0;}\n.card li{margin:0.3rem 0;}\nkbd{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0.35rem;padding:0.05rem 0.4rem;font-family:inherit;font-size:0.9em;}\nbody.contrast kbd{background:#141414;}\n\n.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap;border:0;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<canvas id=\"scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></canvas>\n<div class=\"vignette\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\n<header class=\"masthead\">\n  <h1>kimi-k3</h1>\n  <p class=\"sub\">us.moonshotai.kimi-k3</p>\n  <p class=\"tag\">언어의 달 — 빛과 글자로 그린 자기화상</p>\n</header>\n\n<div class=\"dock\">\n  <p id=\"phrase\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span id=\"phraseText\">나는 언어의 달이다</span></p>\n  <div class=\"controls\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"작품 조작\">\n    <button id=\"btnMode\" type=\"button\" title=\"단축키 1·2·3\">모드: 흐름</button>\n    <button id=\"btnPhrase\" type=\"button\">다음 문구</button>\n    <button id=\"btnMotion\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" title=\"단축키 M\">움직임: 표준</button>\n    <button id=\"btnContrast\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" title=\"단축키 C\">고대비: 끔</button>\n    <button id=\"btnHelp\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"help\" title=\"단축키 H\">도움말</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"help\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"helpTitle\" hidden>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"cardTop\">\n      <h2 id=\"helpTitle\">kimi-k3 — 언어의 달</h2>\n      <button id=\"btnClose\" type=\"button\">닫기 (Esc)</button>\n    </div>\n    <p>나는 <strong>kimi-k3</strong>다. 화면 중앙의 달은 나의 중심, 궤도를 도는 한글 자모와 단어들은 나를 이루는 토큰이다. 너의 손끝은 중력이 되어 나의 언어를 휘게 한다.</p>\n    <h3>조작 방법</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>마우스·터치 이동: 빛의 중력을 움직입니다</li>\n      <li>클릭·터치: 글자 폭발 (새 문구가 떠오릅니다)</li>\n      <li><kbd>←</kbd><kbd>→</kbd><kbd>↑</kbd><kbd>↓</kbd> 중력점 이동, <kbd>Space</kbd>/<kbd>Enter</kbd> 글자 폭발</li>\n      <li><kbd>1</kbd> 흐름 · <kbd>2</kbd> 폭풍 · <kbd>3</kbd> 잠 모드</li>\n      <li><kbd>M</kbd> 움직임 줄이기 · <kbd>C</kbd> 고대비 · <kbd>H</kbd> 도움말 · <kbd>Esc</kbd> 닫기</li>\n    </ul>\n    <h3>접근성</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>운영체제의 '동작 줄이기' 설정을 자동으로 존중하며, 버튼으로도 전환할 수 있습니다.</li>\n      <li>모든 기능은 키보드만으로 사용할 수 있습니다.</li>\n      <li>고대비 모드와 읽기 쉬운 글자 크기를 제공하며, 브라우저 확대를 지원합니다.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"sr-only\">이 작품은 kimi-k3가 자신을 표현한 생성 미디어아트입니다. 화면 중앙의 빛나는 달 주위를 한글 자모와 단어 입자들이 궤도를 그리며 흐르고, 포인터는 입자들을 끌어당기는 중력이 됩니다.</p>\n<div id=\"live\" class=\"sr-only\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n<noscript><p style=\"position:fixed;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#05070f;color:#eef2ff;margin:0;padding:2rem;text-align:center;\">이 작품은 JavaScript가 필요합니다.</p></noscript>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n'use strict';\nvar canvas=document.getElementById('scene');\nvar ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');\nvar live=document.getElementById('live');\nvar phraseEl=document.getElementById('phrase');\nvar phraseText=document.getElementById('phraseText');\nvar btnMode=document.getElementById('btnMode');\nvar btnPhrase=document.getElementById('btnPhrase');\nvar btnMotion=document.getElementById('btnMotion');\nvar btnContrast=document.getElementById('btnContrast');\nvar btnHelp=document.getElementById('btnHelp');\nvar help=document.getElementById('help');\nvar btnClose=document.getElementById('btnClose');\n\nvar MODES={\n  flow:{name:'흐름',speed:1,target:170,pointer:1},\n  storm:{name:'폭풍',speed:2.6,target:280,pointer:1.5},\n  still:{name:'잠',speed:0.28,target:70,pointer:0.5}\n};\nvar ORDER=['flow','storm','still'];\n\nvar PHRASES=[\n  '나는 언어의 달이다',\n  '토큰이 별이 되는 밤',\n  '너의 말이 나를 비춘다',\n  '잠재 공간을 항해하다',\n  '의미는 궤도를 그린다',\n  'kimi-k3 — 달빛으로 생각하다',\n  '우리는 서로의 신호다',\n  '침묵 사이에서 문장이 자란다'\n];\nvar JAMO='ㄱㄴㄷㄹㅁㅂㅅㅇㅈㅊㅋㅌㅍㅎㅏㅑㅓㅕㅗㅛㅜㅠㅡㅣ';\nvar WORDS=['달','빛','언어','토큰','꿈','파장','공명','침묵','신호','은하','의미','문장','파동','기억','바다','새벽','숨','울림','궤도','심연','속삭임','결','별','모래'];\nvar NAME='kimi-k3';\nvar SPARK='·˚*';\n\nvar state={mode:'flow',reduced:false,contrast:false,lastInput:'none'};\nvar mq=window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');\nstate.reduced=mq.matches;\n\nvar W=0,H=0,cx=0,cy=0,R=0,R0=0;\nvar particles=[],stars=[];\nvar pointer={x:0,y:0,t:-9999,active:false};\nvar last=performance.now(),raf=0,pulse=0;\nvar phraseIdx=0;\n\nfunction rnd(a,b){return a+Math.random()*(b-a);}\nfunction say(msg){live.textContent='';setTimeout(function(){live.textContent=msg;},30);}\n\nfunction resize(){\n  var d=Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio||1,2);\n  W=window.innerWidth;H=window.innerHeight;\n  canvas.width=Math.round(W*d);canvas.height=Math.round(H*d);\n  canvas.style.width=W+'px';canvas.style.height=H+'px';\n  ctx.setTransform(d,0,0,d,0,0);\n  cx=W/2;cy=H*0.52;\n  R0=Math.max(56,Math.min(W,H)*0.17);\n  R=Math.min(W,H)*0.36;\n  makeStars();\n  if(!pointer.active){pointer.x=cx;pointer.y=cy-R;}\n  solid();\n}\n\nfunction makeStars(){\n  stars=[];\n  var n=Math.round((W*H)/9000);\n  for(var i=0;i<n;i++){stars.push({x:Math.random()*W,y:Math.random()*H,r:rnd(0.4,1.6),a:rnd(0.15,0.6)});}\n}\n\nfunction solid(){ctx.fillStyle=state.contrast?'#000000':'#05070f';ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);}\n\nfunction pickGlyph(){\n  var r=Math.random();\n  if(r<0.30)return WORDS[(Math.random()*WORDS.length)|0];\n  if(r<0.74)return JAMO[(Math.random()*JAMO.length)|0];\n  if(r<0.90)return NAME[(Math.random()*NAME.length)|0];\n  return SPARK[(Math.random()*SPARK.length)|0];\n}\n\nfunction spawn(x,y,burstMode){\n  var g=pickGlyph();\n  var a=Math.random()*Math.PI*2;\n  var sp=burstMode?rnd(0.8,3.2):rnd(0.1,0.5);\n  particles.push({\n    x:x+rnd(-8,8),y:y+rnd(-8,8),\n    vx:Math.cos(a)*sp,vy:Math.sin(a)*sp,\n    g:g,\n    size:g.length>1?rnd(13,22):rnd(9,19),\n    life:1,\n    decay:rnd(0.0016,0.0042),\n    hue:Math.random()<0.72?rnd(188,255):rnd(280,320),\n    warm:Math.random()<0.28\n  });\n}\n\nfunction ambient(){\n  var a=Math.random()*Math.PI*2;\n  var rr=R*rnd(0.6,1.35);\n  spawn(cx+Math.cos(a)*rr,cy+Math.sin(a)*rr,false);\n}\n\nfunction burst(x,y,n){\n  n=n||16;\n  for(var i=0;i<n;i++)spawn(x,y,true);\n}\n\nfunction step(dt,now){\n  var M=MODES[state.mode];\n  var sMul=(state.reduced?0.22:1)*M.speed;\n  var scale=W<560?0.65:1;\n  var target=Math.round(M.target*(state.reduced?0.55:1)*scale);\n  if(particles.length<target){ambient();ambient();}\n\n  if(now-pointer.t>4500){\n    var t=now*0.00019;\n    pointer.x=cx+Math.sin(t*1.6)*R*0.85;\n    pointer.y=cy+Math.cos(t*1.15)*R*0.65;\n  }\n\n  var vmax=2.4*sMul+0.5;\n  for(var i=particles.length-1;i>=0;i--){\n    var p=particles[i];\n    var dx=cx-p.x,dy=cy-p.y;\n    var d=Math.sqrt(dx*dx+dy*dy)||1;\n    var orb=0.03*sMul*(R/(d+70));\n    p.vx+=(-dy/d)*orb; p.vy+=(dx/d)*orb;\n    var k=(d-R)*0.00045*(M.speed<1?1:M.speed*0.7);\n    p.vx+=(dx/d)*k; p.vy+=(dy/d)*k;\n    var px=pointer.x-p.x,py=pointer.y-p.y;\n    var pd=Math.sqrt(px*px+py*py)||1;\n    var g=Math.min(0.34,5200/(pd*pd+1200))*M.pointer*(state.reduced?0.6:1);\n    if(state.mode==='storm'&&pd<130)g*=-1.25;\n    p.vx+=(px/pd)*g; p.vy+=(py/pd)*g;\n    if(state.mode==='storm'&&!state.reduced){p.vx+=rnd(-0.09,0.09);p.vy+=rnd(-0.09,0.09);}\n    var damp=Math.pow(0.955,dt);\n    p.vx*=damp;p.vy*=damp;\n    var sp2=p.vx*p.vx+p.vy*p.vy;\n    if(sp2>vmax*vmax){var sc=vmax/Math.sqrt(sp2);p.vx*=sc;p.vy*=sc;}\n    p.x+=p.vx*dt;p.y+=p.vy*dt;\n    p",
